  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6:44 P.M.    天氣/晴\n龍門繞城公路，車內"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爺？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爺，您睡著了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "唔，抱歉......我們到哪兒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "就快到約定的碰頭地點了，請打起精神來，少爺。企鵝物流的諸位已經在等著了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "嗯，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "您看上去很疲憊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "沒有的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "請原諒我多嘴，但老爺這次的決定實在是有些倉促，如果少爺有什麼難處，請務必開口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......父親，一定有他自己的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "而且，只要能在企鵝物流有所作為，父親身邊的那些人，說不定就不會再阻攔我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爺是家族有史以來最年輕的信使，您的工作能力無可挑剔，這就足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "也許吧，但是，那些大人們未必會這麼想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爺......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "看看窗外，現在龍門大半的民營信使業務已經落到了父親的手裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "企鵝物流，他們是最後的，也是最獨立的，奇怪傳聞最多的公司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "雖然父親和大帝先生的關係好像很好，可我們必須瞭解他們，至少我得這麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "所以我才會擔心少爺，企鵝物流太過於特殊了，我很清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "你不用總擺出這麼一副表情。我可以自己處理好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "您也是，少爺。多像同齡人一樣笑一笑吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "今晚是安魂夜，您本可以和朋友們一起去街上逛逛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......你是在嘲笑我沒朋友嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "豈敢，豈敢，哈哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "抱歉，少爺，您的盾還在手邊嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "怎麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "我們被盯上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "發現目標，準備好了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "呃，引爆組的導火線似乎有點短......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "那不是問題，動手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "唔——爆炸！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爺，抓穩了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "發現目標，還活著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "把他帶走，動作快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（居然炸毀了公路.....？到底，是誰......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（該死，視野......看不清......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "情況怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "目擊者很多，但沒有看見其他目標人員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "等等，煙霧裡還有其他人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "還有倖存者？那就一起——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "唔呃——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "喂？喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "這麼簡單就被幹掉了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "嘁，我可不喜歡這麼老套的電影戲碼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "企鵝物流。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喲，看來你很清楚嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "不過在我看來，在邊郊公路中央設置路障再埋下炸彈，這手法也是相當復古哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "爆破只是個人愛好，環顧一下你的周圍，事情沒這麼簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "該死，那個蠢貨竟然用了這麼多源石炸藥，如果讓鼠王知道了，我們吃不了兜著走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "發現企鵝物流的信使，是能天使。她把爆破組的人都給......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "我不瞎，無所謂。那隻叫德克薩斯的狼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "不，沒有看見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "哼。那就算了，包圍他們，速戰速決。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "果然還有埋伏，做得挺徹底嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "喂，你還能動嗎？手腳都搖搖晃晃的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......勉強吧，你就是......能天使小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯！你是叫，呃，什麼來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "拜松。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我們......我們得先離開這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "不要繃著一張臉，那位老管家平安無事哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "真的嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "姑且有把他送到路邊，不過看他的樣子其實不太需要幫忙......但是算啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "企鵝物流的能天使，還有這位小少爺，投降吧，跟我們走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "不少生面孔呢，都是你在敘拉古的親戚？有沒有提醒他們在龍門搶生意的注意事項？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "這不關你事，這一次，我們會把你們徹底擊潰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯......在龍門待了這麼多年，你們搶地盤的方式倒是最簡單粗暴的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "看來敘拉古的黑手黨也不是只有在酒吧挨揍的份嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "啊啊......你會後悔小看西西里人的，*龍門粗口*，動手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "哎呀，我這算勉強趕上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "時機完美，可頌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "可他們好像不打算收手耶，接下來怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "老規矩，你開路，我殿後，完事獎金對半分~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "那我就——不客氣了啊啊啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "那，那個怪力瘋子直接撞開了一條路！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "......你們先追，不要跟太緊，等首領的支援。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "是、是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "你把他們放跑了，廢物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "嘁，綁票本來就不是我的長項。企鵝物流其他成員沒有出現，部署完成之前，貿然進入龍門市區對我們不利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "隨便你找藉口，有一輛車向你那兒去了。開著敞篷，可都是熟到發焦的老熟人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "......這麼快？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "啊，不好，這是第幾個死胡同了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "反正周圍都是些幾百年沒人管的爛尾樓，不如直接在牆上開個洞吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "等、等等，兩位！我們到底要去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "他們在這兒！居然鑽到死胡同裡等死，包圍他們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我們這不是無路可退了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "對了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "有什麼對策！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "我們還沒正式打過招呼吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "把他們全部幹掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "現在不是說這個的時候吧！這很重要嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這很重要，非常重要，相當重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我們可是非常注重塑造企業文化的，而今天的文化關鍵字恰好是“儀式感”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "雖然是剛剛決定的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "是、是大帝！快通知首領！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "等等，後面還有一個！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "餌撒空了，能天使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "敘拉古的傢伙們也不全是傻瓜嘛，下次還有機會，別介意別介意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "比起這個，給你們介紹一下，這位就是我們企鵝物流的臨時成員，拜松。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "那傢伙堵住了退路，只、只能動手了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "都躺下，輪不到你們送死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "嘁！不要慌，只要拖到首領的支援——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "拖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "開燈，啊哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "好、好閃！哪兒來的聚光燈！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "歡迎來到企鵝物流，小貓小狗們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "你們已經出現在我的視線之內，而我視線之內就是企鵝帝國的國土。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "不好意思，請問你們的過境簽證有帶在身上嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "那你們得準備好哭著回家找媽媽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
